From: NWA50BE OpenWrt Project <noreply@invalid.example>
Subject: [PATCH] umdns: update past CVE-2026-55492
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

Update umdns to the revision selected by OpenWrt 25.12.5. This bounds
the unauthenticated mDNS cache and clamps hostile TTLs, fixing the
adjacent-network memory-exhaustion issue tracked as CVE-2026-55492.

---
 package/network/services/umdns/Makefile | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/package/network/services/umdns/Makefile b/package/network/services/umdns/Makefile
--- a/package/network/services/umdns/Makefile
+++ b/package/network/services/umdns/Makefile
@@ -10,9 +10,9 @@ PKG_NAME:=umdns
 PKG_RELEASE:=1
 
 PKG_SOURCE_URL=$(PROJECT_GIT)/project/mdnsd.git
 PKG_SOURCE_PROTO:=git
-PKG_SOURCE_DATE:=2026-02-06
-PKG_SOURCE_VERSION:=a52cdb354d13c179150d2ba26f9f8a51d418b43d
-PKG_MIRROR_HASH:=64d6b454aefd208881a130ec0d503e690375565ed3de0171a8c70f5d1a4a25bf
+PKG_SOURCE_DATE:=2026-06-16
+PKG_SOURCE_VERSION:=1b5e7bf1cec775b89f1a6068dc0b9df3593b5986
+PKG_MIRROR_HASH:=7d9ec860af2b8217f65cd4af92a61be1925ad171dee9b536c4914cc0080e3303
 
 PKG_MAINTAINER:=John Crispin <john@phrozen.org>
 PKG_LICENSE:=LGPL-2.1
-- 
